      "text": "In the arena fight for Sacred Feather City’s kingship, after Yu Fei uses Inflated Balloon and floats upward, Dan Yu names Blade Wind Strong Slash. He raises his arms and cuts through the air. Two translucent blades that resemble wind blades fly toward Yu Fei at high speed.",
